---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - tavi-navi"
  description="Privacy policy and data protection practices for tavi-navi."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem;">
    <article class="article-content">
      <h1 style="font-size: 1.85rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-primary); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <h2>1. Use of Personal Information</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit inquiries or comments, we may ask for your name and email address. This personal information will only be used to respond to your questions or communicate relevant updates.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Analytics Tools</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics to analyze traffic anonymously. Traffic data is collected via cookies and does not identify individuals.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive to provide accurate, real-time information, weather conditions, festival schedules, and transport operations may change abruptly. We assume no responsibility for any inconvenience or damages resulting from the use of information on this website.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
